WEBVTT

00:01:59.312 --> 00:02:01.675
from the decomposition of limestone.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:04.696
We then take this calcined clay,

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:06.586
and we add a bit of limestone --

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:10.591
but this time not heated,
so no CO2 emissions --

00:02:10.615 --> 00:02:12.186
and some cement,

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:19.033
and this combination of limestone,
calcined clay and cement, we call LC3.

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:21.983
Now this LC3 here

00:02:22.007 --> 00:02:25.727
has the same properties
as Portland cement.

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:29.653
It can be produced
with the same equipment and processes

00:02:29.677 --> 00:02:31.646
and used in the same way,